{"v":1,"runId":"run_4hN7Q1M-b-","seq":4,"t":31391,"at":"2026-10-18T15:50:32.785Z","type":"plan.proposed","data":{"plan":{"title":"Late-Night Boba Delivery for UCLA Dorms: Work Plan","summary":"The bet is that UCLA students living in campus dorms will order late-night boba delivered to their residence halls, so Scout validates demand and logistics, Maker builds the waitlist site, and Herald prepares the launch outreach.","tasks":[{"id":"t1","owner":"scout","title":"Scout UCLA late-night boba demand","instructions":"Research the late-night boba market for UCLA students living in campus dorms in Westwood. Identify competitor boba shops near UCLA, their closing times, delivery-app coverage, fees, minimums, and service gaps after 10pm; document UCLA dorm delivery/access rules and peak demand windows; survey flavor/price preferences from student forums/social if available. Return a concise research brief with demand signals, risks, target dorm list, recommended hours/pricing, and a go/no-go recommendation.","deliverable":"research","dependsOn":[],"enabled":true},{"id":"t2","owner":"maker","title":"Build waitlist landing page for boba delivery","instructions":"Build one self-contained, mobile-first landing page for Late-Night UCLA Boba, targeting UCLA students living in campus dorms in Westwood. Include the value proposition, delivery hours and eligible dorms/areas, sample menu with prices, delivery fee/minimum, dorm-lobby pickup details, waitlist signup form, FAQ, and contact/social links. Use a single HTML file with inline CSS/JS, no external assets or frameworks, and keep it fast and accessible.","deliverable":"site","dependsOn":["t1"],"enabled":true},{"id":"t3","owner":"herald","title":"Draft launch kit for UCLA boba delivery","instructions":"Create the launch kit for Late-Night UCLA Boba for UCLA students living in campus dorms in Westwood. Write three launch posts for Instagram/TikTok/GroupMe promoting late-night boba delivery to dorm lobbies, plus three to five outreach emails to dorm RA groups, student clubs/organizations, and campus food/lifestyle accounts inviting them to share the waitlist. Keep tone student-friendly, include CTA, hours, delivery zones, and ask for resharing or partnerships.","deliverable":"launch_kit","dependsOn":["t1"],"enabled":true}],"questions":[]},"source":"model"}}
