{"v":1,"runId":"run_4hN7Q1M-b-","seq":7,"t":133782,"at":"2026-10-18T15:52:15.176Z","type":"plan.approved","data":{"plan":{"title":"Late-Night Boba Delivery for UCLA Dorms: Work Plan","summary":"The bet is that UCLA students living in campus dorms will order late-night boba delivered to their residence halls, so Scout validates demand and logistics, Maker builds the waitlist site, and Herald prepares the launch outreach.","tasks":[{"id":"t1","owner":"scout","title":"Scout UCLA late-night boba demand","instructions":"Research late-night boba delivery for UCLA dorms in Westwood. Verify at least 3 real competitors, prices, hours and delivery coverage with links; cite UCLA rules for overnight dorm access and identify permitted lobby handoff zones. Return exactly the research JSON schema: competitors, audience, priceBand, up to 3 gaps, sources. Distinguish documented facts from assumptions. Do not invent customer interviews or willingness-to-pay figures.","deliverable":"research","dependsOn":[],"enabled":true},{"id":"t2","owner":"maker","title":"Build waitlist landing page for boba delivery","instructions":"Using Scout research, build a mobile-first waitlist landing page for late-night boba delivery to UCLA dorm lobbies. Include researched pricing, proposed hours, service areas, menu, FAQ and a clearly labeled prototype waitlist/contact CTA. Return site JSON with headline and full self-contained HTML under 120 KB, inline CSS, no JavaScript or remote assets. Footer: Built by Headcount: 1. Show unknown operational details as proposals; do not claim the business is already operating.","deliverable":"site","dependsOn":["t1"],"enabled":true},{"id":"t3","owner":"herald","title":"Draft launch kit for UCLA boba delivery","instructions":"Use Scout research and supplied siteUrl to draft X, LinkedIn and Instagram posts plus 3 outreach emails (RA, student club, campus creator) for a proposed UCLA dorm-lobby boba service. Every post/email must include the exact supplied siteUrl. Return launch_kit JSON {posts:{x,linkedin,instagram},emails:[{persona,subject,body}]}. Keep claims grounded; label launch as a proposed pilot/waitlist and do not invent interviews, endorsements or an operating business. Draft only; send nothing.","deliverable":"launch_kit","dependsOn":["t1"],"enabled":true}],"questions":[]},"edited":true}}
